### Order steps API v1 (the assembly line). Every request needs the access token from the sign in request below.
### Select the "local" environment (http/http-client.env.json). Run requests top to bottom.
### Run the orders.http requests first (or place any order with no approval stages) so a step is Ready.

### Sign in (put login and password in http/http-client.private.env.json, which is git-ignored)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{login}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Work queue: Ready steps of your departments (admins see all)
# @name queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps?status=Ready
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get the first step of the queue (waitMinutes and workMinutes run to now while open)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Assign (employees only themselves; managers any member of the step's department)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }

### Start (assignee or a manager of the department)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Report progress (0 to 99)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "progress": 50, "note": "Halfway through the batch" }

### Put on hold (reason required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Machine fault" }

### Resume
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Complete (the next step becomes Ready; the last open step completes the order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Step history (append-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Reject the work back to the previous step (409 for a first step or one that cannot reject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Scratched surface" }

### Empty hold reason returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/{{queue.response.body.$[0].id}}/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

### Unknown step returns 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps/999999/start
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Without a token returns 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/order-steps
Accept: application/json
